1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,300
This is the corner.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,400
Hang on. That's our name.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,800
I said not that one.

4
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:17,400
Okay. I won't send it.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,350
People think I kept the money.

6
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,610
That's me in the picture.

7
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:29,270
I know. I won't use it.

8
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:31,530
Not the other one either.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,300
All right, you carry yours. I'll take this.

10
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,400
Don't look in it.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,800
How much did they pay you, Mara?

12
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,900
Let us through. We have an appointment.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,300
Just give us the number.

14
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:06,900
Not here. She's nine.

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,800
This way. Use the side door.

16
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:17,900
Don't let him see my book.

17
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,300
We're live.

18
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:27,400
You can't film in here.

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,800
I don't want to go back out.

20
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:42,400
Okay. We'll stay here for a bit.

21
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,960
Does he know which room?

22
00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:52,010
No. He can't come through that door.

23
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:54,660
Can we leave a different way?

24
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:58,490
I'll ask. We don't have to go past him.

25
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,700
We gave them the clinic's name. And her voice. I left that in.

26
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,900
Pull the original.

27
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,300
We lose the whole feature if we do.

28
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,900
Do it.

29
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,920
They've already copied it. We can't take those down ourselves.

30
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:42,540
I know. Take ours down. I'll tell her what we did.

31
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Our video's down. The photos too. I'm sorry. You don't have to call me back.

32
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,800
All of it?

33
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:06,900
Not the first paragraph.

34
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,530
You wrote this part. Why take it out now?

35
00:03:16,830 --> 00:03:21,140
It's her daughter. She didn't ask to be in my statement.

36
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:23,400
Then we leave her out.

37
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,800
Some of your fundraisers won't like this.

38
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:36,400
Post that part. Put my name on it.

39
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,750
Even the ones raising money for me.

40
00:03:45,050 --> 00:03:48,180
I'll post exactly what you signed. No introduction.

41
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,580
Okay.
